<title>USA: NYSE says asks Duracell to issue public statement.</title>
<headline>NYSE says asks Duracell to issue public statement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that it has contacted Duracell International Inc requesting the company to issue a public statement indicating whether there are any corporate developments.</p>
<p>The request was made in view of the unusual market activity in the company's stock.  NYSE said that Duracell declined to comment.</p>
<p>Reports that Duracell is expected to be purchased by Gillette Co in a $7 billion stock merger deal pushed Duracell stock up 6-5/8 to 55 in mid-morning activity.</p>
</text>
